        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for your shift?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a convenience store employee in Mexico, handling everyday tasks like sweeping, restocking shelves, and taking out the trash. But be careful — you never know what might happen late at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game that blends daily routine with the tension of facing the unexpected, reflecting the harsh reality of those who encounter danger day after day without seeking it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To change to English language select &quot;Idioma&quot; -&gt; English.</i></p>",
